### 1) Utwórz nowe ćwiczenie
POST http://localhost:5002/api/exercise
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "name": "Deadlift",
  "muscleGroup": "Backs",
  "equipment": "Barbell",
  "duration": 45
}

### 2) Dodaj pierwszy result do tego ćwiczenia
POST http://localhost:5002/api/exercise/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/result
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb",
  "set": 1,
  "reps": 5,
  "weight": 120,
  "personalBest": false
}

### 3) Dodaj drugi result do tego samego ćwiczenia
POST http://localhost:5002/api/exercise/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/result
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "cccccccc-cccc-cccc-cccc-cccccccccccc",
  "set": 2,
  "reps": 5,
  "weight": 130,
  "personalBest": true
}

### 4) Sprawdź, że są 2 wyniki dla tego ćwiczenia
GET http://localhost:5002/api/exercise/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/result

### 5) Usuń ćwiczenie
DELETE http://localhost:5002/api/exercise/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### 6) Sprawdź, że ćwiczenie już nie istnieje (powinno zwrócić 404)
GET http://localhost:5002/api/exercise/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### 7) Sprawdź, że lista wyników dla tego ćwiczenia jest pusta
GET http://localhost:5002/api/exercise/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/result

### 8) Spróbuj dodać wynik do usuniętego ćwiczenia (powinno być 404, jeśli walidujesz exerciseId)
POST http://localhost:5002/api/exercise/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/result
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "dddddddd-dddd-dddd-dddd-dddddddddddd",
  "set": 3,
  "reps": 3,
  "weight": 140,
  "personalBest": false
}
